Invalid Input Error: Glue table 'default.pw_enum_int': partition value 3 of 'hour' is not one its projection derives (projection.hour.values = 1, 2)

statement ok
DROP TABLE my_datalake.default.pw_enum_int;

# an integer key on a DOUBLE column: the value must be the integer itself
